    {
      "case": "05",
      "title": "四路径改六路径：先预算片上存储",
      "workflow": "W03",
      "editorial_note": "旧版本BRAM剩余不足，方案止于评估；不宣称已完成六路径实现。",
      "messages": [
        {
          "source": "T5",
          "thread_id": "01a0f53a-be59-7bb3-83e2-12356360e408",
          "turn_id": "01a12143-b5f6-71f0-902c-afa1339e96d8",
          "message_id": "01a12143-bbcc-7ae1-94cf-c17d07338704",
          "role": "userMessage",
          "phase": null,
          "text": "如果现在以太网已经接好了并且把所有的极线矫正但是帧率不高有什么办法吗，还有就是现在是四路径代价聚合可以改成6路径吗",
          "excerpt": true,
          "start_char": 0,
          "end_char": 57,
          "original_text_sha256": "b0c536c58266c67f15fce8b96d8f29ac7df0ddff4336783cb3e5e626e0485fc7"
        },
        {
          "source": "T5",
          "thread_id": "01a0f53a-be59-7bb3-83e2-12356360e408",
          "turn_id": "01a12143-b5f6-71f0-902c-afa1339e96d8",
          "message_id": "msg_0520e587050d7155016ac90853779887d099ee2db0033089f3",
          "role": "agentMessage",
          "phase": "final_answer",
          "text": "有办法提高帧率；**先定位慢在哪一段，再考虑六路径**。六路径主要改善视差质量，不能解决网口或整帧矫正造成的掉帧。\n\n先澄清当前状态：我检查的[现有工程](F:/qiansaifpga/dual_ov5640_sgbm_z7020_ok/dual_ov5640_sgbm_z7020_vivado2022_2/dual_ov5640_sgbm_z7020.srcs/sources_1/bd/system/system.bd)还没有启用 PS 以太网，也没有接入黑金板的整帧矫正结果。以下针对你说的**两板图像通路完成后，帧率不高**这一情况。\n\n### 帧率低时，按这个顺序查\n\n给同一帧编号，分别记录「相机采集完成、黑金板接收完成、矫正完成、正点原子板收到结果、HDMI 显示」的时间。这样一次测试就能知道瓶颈：\n\n| 慢的位置 | 优先办法 |\n|---|---|\n| 网口传输 | 双路只传灰度图；检查实际协商到 **1000M**，减少逐包复制，先测双向同时传输速度和丢包 |\n| 黑金板矫正 | 让 PL 处理整帧；优化 DDR 连续读取和行缓存，左右图并行处理，避免 ARM 逐像素查表 |\n| 等待网络或 CNN | 采集、矫正、显示使用不同帧缓冲；CNN 隔几帧识别一次，**不让视频等 CNN** |\n| 矫正图回传太慢 | 把 **SGBM 也移到黑金板**，只回传一张视差图和距离、识别结果，减少回程图像量 |\n\n帧缓冲还要确保读写不碰同一帧；AMD 的 VDMA 文档也把多帧缓冲和 Genlock 用于处理生产、消费速度不同引起的画面撕裂。[AMD VDMA 帧同步说明](https://docs.amd.com/r/en-US/pg020_axi_vdma/Genlock-Synchronization)\n\n我最推荐先测 **“双路灰度发送 → 黑金板矫正 → 双路矫正图返回”**各阶段帧率。如果回传确实是瓶颈，再采用“黑金板完成矫正和 SGBM，只返回视差图”的分工；不要一开始就同时改通信、矫正和六路径，否则难判断是哪处导致掉帧。\n\n### 四路径能改成六路径吗？\n\n**算法上能，当前这份 7020 工程不能直接加两个模块就下板。**现在的四条路径是从左、上、左上、右上方向聚合；聚合代码在[四路径模块](F:/qiansaifpga/dual_ov5640_sgbm_z7020_ok/dual_ov5640_sgbm_z7020_vivado2022_2/rtl/sgbm_cost_aggregation_top.v)。当前实现已经使用 **123/140 块 BRAM**，只剩 17 块，时序余量 WNS 为 **+0.279 ns**，见[实现报告](F:/qiansaifpga/dual_ov5640_sgbm_z7020_ok/dual_ov5640_sgbm_z7020_vivado2022_2/output_vivado2023_2_cursor_keys/reports/utilization_impl.rpt)。现有每条纵向或斜向路径使用两组 `1280×288 bit` 行状态存储；新增两条同类路径，仅原始存储位数的下限就约需 **40 块 BRAM36**，超过剩余容量，尚未计入其它逻辑。\n\n如果新方向选**从右、从下**，还涉及反向扫描、保存和合并代价，通常需要额外的帧存储和处理遍数；它也不是把路径计数从 4 改成 6 那么简单。更多方向可能改善某些条纹和弱纹理区域，但收益要拿相同实拍图比较，不能保证解决 20 cm 的遮挡重影。OpenCV 对完整多方向模式也提示了更高的内存需求。[OpenCV StereoSGBM 说明](https://docs.opencv.org/4.13.0/d2/d85/classcv_1_1StereoSGBM.html)\n\n**建议顺序：先稳定整帧矫正和帧率，保留当前四路径作对照；若画质仍需要提升，再在黑金板重新规划 SGBM、存储和 CNN 的资源，制作独立六路径版本并比较帧率、轮廓与距离误差。**当前没有六路径 bit 文件，也没有实测过两板矫正后的帧率。",
          "excerpt": false,
          "start_char": 0,
          "end_char": 1745,
          "original_text_sha256": "9dd7e9480c13b6dd3499a1835e0388560799c481e7d308223af8a222d64f2c08"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "case": "06",
      "title": "目标板混淆与初始化退出导致无通信",
      "workflow": "W04",
      "editorial_note": "模型曾认错下载目标，应保留承认错误；功能禁用状态不应与初始化失败混淆。",
      "messages": [
        {
          "source": "T6",
          "thread_id": "01a18187-2484-7303-a2ef-4d5dccb92b55",
          "turn_id": "01a191c0-75d3-7b51-b45b-975426b66fe0",
          "message_id": "msg_0e8b9a9ff6474b59016ae5d7cf50d8819bbf295a0e15368c9f",
          "role": "agentMessage",
          "phase": "commentary",
          "text": "原因已确认：当前 AX7020 工程把双核校验加速设为关闭，但初始化函数却把“关闭”返回成“失败”，主程序于是直接退出。我已修正这个返回值，现在重新编译并下板验证网络握手和画面。",
          "excerpt": false,
          "start_char": 0,
          "end_char": 89,
          "original_text_sha256": "42978724d1d67a1f822387b63af8c645f2796321ec08b09feeab875fd96559fa"
        },
        {
          "source": "T6",
          "thread_id": "01a18187-2484-7303-a2ef-4d5dccb92b55",
          "turn_id": "01a191c0-75d3-7b51-b45b-975426b66fe0",
          "message_id": "msg_0e8b9a9ff6474b59016ae5d9f91eb8819bab8f4a803bf3bea8",
          "role": "agentMessage",
          "phase": "commentary",
          "text": "明白了，JTAG 下载线现在接的是领航者。刚才通过这根线读到的是 AX7020 应用的诊断标记，说明我把 AX7020 程序下载到了领航者上；这会让领航者串口和画面异常。抱歉，我先把领航者恢复为它自己的程序，再核对串口。",
          "excerpt": false,
          "start_char": 0,
          "end_char": 110,
          "original_text_sha256": "c9b581145d38535e19e45ceeed5b5087e2c8630d0e95c1fa55920e68b5d168e3"
        },
        {
          "source": "T6",
          "thread_id": "01a18187-2484-7303-a2ef-4d5dccb92b55",
          "turn_id": "01a191c0-75d3-7b51-b45b-975426b66fe0",
          "message_id": "01a191e0-bb40-7e72-b89d-009bf3ce0c25",
          "role": "userMessage",
          "phase": null,
          "text": "不是，迁移之前还是好的，迁移后就出问题了，而且以太网还是没通信",
          "excerpt": true,
          "start_char": 0,
          "end_char": 31,
          "original_text_sha256": "22731e552e5b7153dadcd232966ac4200384b9fb8e7a8629319d003d2764abef"
        },
        {
          "source": "T6",
          "thread_id": "01a18187-2484-7303-a2ef-4d5dccb92b55",
          "turn_id": "01a191c0-75d3-7b51-b45b-975426b66fe0",
          "message_id": "msg_0e8b9a9ff6474b59016ae5dba5ca6c819ba788ed6c00c04dc0",
          "role": "agentMessage",
          "phase": "commentary",
          "text": "双板以太网现在已经通信：AX7020 收到数据包，领航者日志从 `peer=0` 变成 `peer=1`。深度图仍没有出现，因为领航者的采集流程在反复中止（`aborted` 快速增加）。我继续追这个采集错误，不会把“网口已通”当成整套功能已恢复。",
          "excerpt": false,
          "start_char": 0,
          "end_char": 124,
          "original_text_sha256": "5725c979344ff63eb12b133924f35bbda59a76f9ef2e06583473f3fe077d9041"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "case": "07",
      "title": "DMA槽位推测错误与采集恢复",
      "workflow": "W04",
      "editorial_note": "硬件计数仍增长时，应检查软件选择的缓冲槽位及完成状态。",
      "messages": [
        {
          "source": "T6",
          "thread_id": "01a18187-2484-7303-a2ef-4d5dccb92b55",
          "turn_id": "01a191c0-75d3-7b51-b45b-975426b66fe0",
          "message_id": "msg_0e8b9a9ff6474b59016ae5dbf1f83c819b9aa11c21fe049c0f",
          "role": "agentMessage",
          "phase": "commentary",
          "text": "AX7020 的内部日志也确认：它已收到领航者的控制包并建立同一个会话，网络问题已经排除。现在卡在领航者摄像头取帧：`copied=0` 且 `aborted` 快速增加。我需要读领航者采集硬件的帧计数和 DMA 状态，才能判断是迁移后的硬件配置还是摄像头输入问题。",
          "excerpt": false,
          "start_char": 0,
          "end_char": 133,
          "original_text_sha256": "b2a39fba477ab718c988c549f5dcdcb9a1b841e837b88873546392520cbd1a63"
        },
        {
          "source": "T6",
          "thread_id": "01a18187-2484-7303-a2ef-4d5dccb92b55",
          "turn_id": "01a191c0-75d3-7b51-b45b-975426b66fe0",
          "message_id": "msg_0e8b9a9ff6474b59016ae5dcc2eb78819bb0531e875491106a",
          "role": "agentMessage",
          "phase": "commentary",
          "text": "从寄存器看，两路摄像头约每秒 30 帧，DMA 没报硬错误；但软件用“全局帧号取模 3”猜测缓存槽位。JTAG 重下时摄像头计数和 DMA 槽位可能不同步，这与连续丢帧相符。我会改为读取 DMA 当前槽位来选择最近完成的帧，并重新构建领航者程序验证。",
          "excerpt": false,
          "start_char": 0,
          "end_char": 125,
          "original_text_sha256": "a00e12c0d14ec178a6522a1bb77403043ca115d290eea814e1e07f21d6d3f479"
        },
        {
          "source": "T6",
          "thread_id": "01a18187-2484-7303-a2ef-4d5dccb92b55",
          "turn_id": "01a191c0-75d3-7b51-b45b-975426b66fe0",
          "message_id": "msg_0e8b9a9ff6474b59016ae5ddbc6904819bbf054ab7cf86506a",
          "role": "agentMessage",
          "phase": "commentary",
          "text": "采集链已经恢复：领航者日志中 `copied`、`rectified`、`sent` 都持续增加，`aborted` 只出现 1 次，双板 `peer=1`。这说明摄像头取帧、校正和网口传输都在工作。现在请直接看显示器并试一次按键，我会同步看串口是否收到操作。",
          "excerpt": false,
          "start_char": 0,
          "end_char": 130,
          "original_text_sha256": "29d71863054e64a84342f3cda5659a9264cb77ca351134a03fc71603e2e95d81"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "case": "08",
      "title": "恢复原构建参数，解决迁移后卡顿",
      "workflow": "W06",
      "editorial_note": "约28fps为发送速率；用户确认流畅度与操作恢复，不能据此补写精确深度输出帧率。",
      "messages": [
        {
          "source": "T6",
          "thread_id": "01a18187-2484-7303-a2ef-4d5dccb92b55",
          "turn_id": "01a191c0-75d3-7b51-b45b-975426b66fe0",
          "message_id": "01a191ea-bd3e-72c2-8bcd-27ed967c6d00",
          "role": "userMessage",
          "phase": null,
          "text": "有深度图但是很卡帧率没有之前版本帧率高",
          "excerpt": true,
          "start_char": 231,
          "end_char": 250,
          "original_text_sha256": "211f2c5e5992883cab1737ed449271873affae2da1d87cf6c1bb2e1710e45416"
        },
        {
          "source": "T6",
          "thread_id": "01a18187-2484-7303-a2ef-4d5dccb92b55",
          "turn_id": "01a191c0-75d3-7b51-b45b-975426b66fe0",
          "message_id": "01a191ec-8dc1-7c03-86b3-1956a2c66f1c",
          "role": "userMessage",
          "phase": null,
          "text": "你就改成之前的帧数版本，就只是迁移过来，不要动别的",
          "excerpt": true,
          "start_char": 0,
          "end_char": 25,
          "original_text_sha256": "b3aa49a4dfab31b2f8f69b37df51e9aac72ed5bea4bc4319d2b1683d619b4aa6"
        },
        {
          "source": "T6",
          "thread_id": "01a18187-2484-7303-a2ef-4d5dccb92b55",
          "turn_id": "01a191c0-75d3-7b51-b45b-975426b66fe0",
          "message_id": "msg_0e8b9a9ff6474b59016ae5dec8f7b0819b8018db349a186acf",
          "role": "agentMessage",
          "phase": "commentary",
          "text": "我查到迁移前交接包使用的是优化编译和 AX7020 的硬件校验模块；当前 AX7020 上的临时程序是低优化构建，容易拉低画面帧率。我会用交接包同一套源码和构建选项在 2026.1 重编 AX7020，只保留领航者取帧所需的兼容修正。",
          "excerpt": false,
          "start_char": 0,
          "end_char": 117,
          "original_text_sha256": "e594e64206cf37c246183a6ade8caf487744a5604cdb26622a899da07d94ffa6"
        },
        {
          "source": "T6",
          "thread_id": "01a18187-2484-7303-a2ef-4d5dccb92b55",
          "turn_id": "01a191c0-75d3-7b51-b45b-975426b66fe0",
          "message_id": "msg_0e8b9a9ff6474b59016ae5df5a40e4819b89d080fc947e27a2",
          "role": "agentMessage",
          "phase": "commentary",
          "text": "已按迁移前的构建选项重下 AX7020。领航者的实际发送速率从约 **13 帧/秒升到 28 帧/秒**，`peer=1` 持续，采集与校正也跟上了。接下来我只核对 AX7020 实际输出帧数和你看到的画面流畅度。",
          "excerpt": false,
          "start_char": 0,
          "end_char": 107,
          "original_text_sha256": "d039e5c158f17cecaf473ba0df85346a92fa6498dfeb19713f65f3c7eaae943f"
        },
        {
          "source": "T6",
          "thread_id": "01a18187-2484-7303-a2ef-4d5dccb92b55",
          "turn_id": "01a191c0-75d3-7b51-b45b-975426b66fe0",
          "message_id": "01a191f1-3d56-7ef2-a4b3-624a8077e63b",
          "role": "userMessage",
          "phase": null,
          "text": "已恢复到以前的流畅度",
          "excerpt": true,
          "start_char": 235,
          "end_char": 245,
          "original_text_sha256": "5c018fac487facddfc530ec1a828343814cd4bf6c848d72ece098c1d0dac9818"
        },
        {
          "source": "T6",
          "thread_id": "01a18187-2484-7303-a2ef-4d5dccb92b55",
          "turn_id": "01a191c0-75d3-7b51-b45b-975426b66fe0",
          "message_id": "01a191f1-fc9d-7b41-9e77-9d0720813533",
          "role": "userMessage",
          "phase": null,
          "text": "两项都正常",
          "excerpt": true,
          "start_char": 194,
          "end_char": 199,
          "original_text_sha256": "e86483fc81bd92d9ae88a948c7e958774fa0296a7e8cf561a103b28eeda08fbb"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "case": "09",
      "title": "4路并行估算有收益，整机Slice反而升高",
      "workflow": "W05",
      "editorial_note": "保留乐观估算被布线结果推翻的完整转折；最终未采用4路版本。",
      "messages": [
        {
          "source": "T6",
          "thread_id": "01a18187-2484-7303-a2ef-4d5dccb92b55",
          "turn_id": "01a194f3-735e-7310-b084-9f299748c363",
          "message_id": "msg_0e8b9a9ff6474b59016ae6a5836c78819bbef99364eef1c891",
          "role": "agentMessage",
          "phase": "commentary",
          "text": "结果很有价值：4 路版本在 297 组测试、695,964 个输出字节上与 8 路版本完全一致。HLS 估算显示 LUT 从 36,645 降到 32,372，寄存器从 28,681 降到 26,361，BRAM18 从 61 降到 33；这已经具备把整机 Slice 压到 90%附近的可能。我现在把 4 路核封装到隔离工程，做完整整机布局布线，真实 Slice 数会比 HLS 估算更可信。",
          "excerpt": false,
          "start_char": 0,
          "end_char": 197,
          "original_text_sha256": "4c2c3c6ccd9484c74a8bc49c9c84ffba623a93f5941ad268a136eb265da0bf17"
        },
        {
          "source": "T6",
          "thread_id": "01a18187-2484-7303-a2ef-4d5dccb92b55",
          "turn_id": "01a194f3-735e-7310-b084-9f299748c363",
          "message_id": "msg_0e8b9a9ff6474b59016ae6b11c8a78819b9aa2abcd270f09b1",
          "role": "agentMessage",
          "phase": "commentary",
          "text": "首个整机结果出来了：这条路不合格。虽然省了 31 个 DSP、15 个 BRAM、1360 LUT、2408 FF，但 Slice 反而从 98.65% 升到 99.44%，且原频率下 WNS 为 -0.293 ns。说明瓶颈不是乘加器数量，而是寄存器/控制集合造成的切片装箱碎片；我不会下板这个版本，继续针对真正的 Slice 占用原因做实验。",
          "excerpt": false,
          "start_char": 0,
          "end_char": 173,
          "original_text_sha256": "147ef8e484bd9dbae96f94f70e109cd1294b15edb2a2c41456cdc314318b65a6"
        },
        {
          "source": "T6",
          "thread_id": "01a18187-2484-7303-a2ef-4d5dccb92b55",
          "turn_id": "01a194f3-735e-7310-b084-9f299748c363",
          "message_id": "msg_0e8b9a9ff6474b59016ae6b14c6490819b933fbb6e0a359f27",
          "role": "agentMessage",
          "phase": "commentary",
          "text": "下一项实验更直接：保持原来的 8 路并行和全部算法精度，把人脸核里明确指定为 LUTRAM 的参数缓存迁到尚有余量的 BRAM。它不改变计算结果，也不应降低推理吞吐；如果成功，会释放大量只能塞进特定 Slice 的分布式存储，正对当前瓶颈。先做等价测试与 HLS 资源估算。",
          "excerpt": false,
          "start_char": 0,
          "end_char": 137,
          "original_text_sha256": "e4b9b4e2aa31d214867ed4708a8ef76999c13603d384b6f4a3a5cda8c204e97f"
        },
        {
          "source": "T6",
          "thread_id": "01a18187-2484-7303-a2ef-4d5dccb92b55",
          "turn_id": "01a194f3-735e-7310-b084-9f299748c363",
          "message_id": "01a19528-e3c6-7081-83c9-727dad5727d9",
          "role": "userMessage",
          "phase": null,
          "text": "但都不能太高了，所有的资源占用量都不能超过90%",
          "excerpt": true,
          "start_char": 0,
          "end_char": 24,
          "original_text_sha256": "fa52bc4be2600bfe3eb203b31b05874b12782af0697baca2870f2c52637a3399"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "case": "10",
      "title": "缓存映射、等价移位与紧凑布局组合",
      "workflow": "W05",
      "editorial_note": "等价测试覆盖有限；五类主要资源达标，仍需阅读资源全表和I/O约束缺项。",
